DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nWe shall meet at the bandstand in Prior
 y Park for #1 of the six week course.\nWe shall start with run/walk and pro
 gress over the weeks. Each session will have a warmup\, a running activity 
 and a cool down taking about 40 to 50 minutes. \nPlease come and support or
  if you have not been running regularly and wish to get back into it\, then
  please do join us. \nHopefully the clock’s changing may give us more day
 light\, however be prepared to have hi viz and torches. \nAny questions\, S
 arah (run leader) [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.st
